      "id": "NVC-01",
      "chapter": "inputs",
      "anchor": "inputs-nearby-cramer",
      "title": "Bounding one frame coordinate by replacing a Gram column",
      "statement": "For a positive semidefinite Hermitian N by N matrix G with diagonal entries at most one and a complex vector c with c*Gc≤1, every coordinate satisfies |det G| |c_a|≤N!≤N^N.",
      "hypotheses": "The chapter uses N≥1. The identity for the replacement determinant and the determinant-weighted estimate both allow G to be singular.",
      "dependencies": [],
      "equations": [],
